    lnd_features_label: 'Everything in one platform',
    lnd_features_title_html: 'Elite tools.<br>For every level.',
    lnd_features_sub: 'From daily tracking to biomedical analysis, LabX centralizes everything you need to train and race better.',
    lnd_feat1_t: 'PMC · Training load', lnd_feat1_d: 'CTL, ATL and TSB calculated in real time from your Garmin activities. See your fitness and avoid overtraining.',
    lnd_feat2_t: 'Garmin Connect · Automatic sync', lnd_feat2_d: 'Automatic daily sync. Swim, Bike, Run, Strength — every activity processed with power, HR, pace and GPS.',
    lnd_feat3_t: 'Blood Labs · Blood work analysis', lnd_feat3_d: 'Upload your lab results and correlate biomarkers (HbA1c, ferritin, testosterone) with your on-track performance.',
    lnd_feat4_t: 'Nutrition · Calorimetry', lnd_feat4_d: 'Fueling strategy for long distances, energy balance, carb loading and nutrition personalized per session.',
    lnd_feat5_t: 'AI Coach · Prescriptions', lnd_feat5_d: 'AI engine that generates personalized workouts, CTL projections and detects injury risk based on your real history.',
    lnd_feat6_t: 'Adaptive Plan · Race Day', lnd_feat6_d: 'Your weekly plan adjusts itself based on your TSB, available days and race proximity. On race day, pacing based on your CTL, hour-by-hour nutrition and finish-time prediction.',
    lnd_feat7_t: 'HRV · Recovery', lnd_feat7_d: 'Daily readiness score from HRV, sleep and accumulated fatigue. Know when to push and when to rest.',
    lnd_feat8_t: 'GPS · Activity detail', lnd_feat8_d: 'Animated maps per discipline, segment analysis, mean-max power curve and session-to-session comparison.',
    lnd_feat9_t: 'My Data Footprint', lnd_feat9_d: 'See how much real history you have synced by category — activities, sleep, HRV, load — with a dynamic flower that grows with every data point connected.',
    lnd_feat10_t: 'ACWR by Discipline', lnd_feat10_d: 'Injury risk is tissue-specific: a running load spike isn\'t offset by less cycling. LabX calculates the acute:chronic ratio per sport, not just overall.',
    lnd_feat11_t: 'Mental Performance', lnd_feat11_d: 'Neurocognitive fatigue score and mental recovery protocols. The part of performance most training apps ignore entirely.',
    lnd_feat12_t: 'Community', lnd_feat12_d: 'Activity feed, kudos and comments, clubs with group challenges, leaderboard and notifications when someone reacts to your training. Training with data doesn\'t have to be lonely.',
    lnd_feat13_t: 'Mobile App · Installable', lnd_feat13_d: 'Your plan for the day, planned-vs-actual comparison with map and zones, GPS tracker and wellness check-in from your phone — install LabX as a native app, no store download needed.',
    lnd_card1_t: 'Training Load', lnd_card1_d: 'Real-time CTL, ATL and TSB from your Garmin activities, plus injury risk (ACWR) calculated per discipline — a spike in running load isn\'t offset by less cycling.',
    lnd_card2_t: 'Garmin Sync & GPS', lnd_card2_d: 'Automatic daily sync across every discipline, with power, HR, pace, animated maps, power curve and session-to-session comparison.',
    lnd_card3_t: 'Recovery & mind', lnd_card3_d: 'Daily readiness from HRV, sleep and accumulated fatigue, plus a mental fatigue score and recovery protocols — knows when to push and when to back off.',
    lnd_card4_t: 'Nutrition & Blood Labs', lnd_card4_d: 'Fueling, carb loading and per-session personalized nutrition, correlated with your lab biomarkers (HbA1c, ferritin, testosterone).',
    lnd_card5_t: 'AI Coach & Adaptive Plan', lnd_card5_d: 'Smart prescriptions that adjust themselves to your TSB and how close race day is. On race day: pacing, hour-by-hour nutrition and a finish-time predictor.',
    lnd_card6_t: 'Community & Mobile app', lnd_card6_d: 'Feed, kudos and clubs with group challenges — plus the same platform installable on your phone, with GPS tracker and wellness check-in, no app store download needed.',
    lnd_how_label: 'Get started in minutes', lnd_how_title: 'This simple.',
    lnd_how1_t: 'Create your account', lnd_how1_d: 'Sign up in 30 seconds. No credit card. Immediate access to the basic plan.',
    lnd_how2_t: 'Connect Garmin', lnd_how2_d: 'Enter your Garmin Connect credentials and your latest activities sync automatically.',
    lnd_how3_t: 'Analyze and improve', lnd_how3_d: 'Your PMC, training zones and recovery analysis are ready in your dashboard instantly.',
    lnd_how4_t: 'Coach or solo', lnd_how4_d: 'Work with a coach who sees your data in real time, or train independently with the AI Coach.',
    lnd_roles_label: 'Built for two roles', lnd_roles_title_html: 'Coaches and Athletes.<br>One ecosystem.',
    lnd_role_coach_label: 'For coaches', lnd_role_coach_title: 'Manage your team',
    lnd_role_coach_desc: 'Prescribe workouts, monitor each athlete\'s load and catch risks before they happen — all from one dashboard.',
    lnd_role_coach_f1: '360° view of every athlete', lnd_role_coach_f2: 'Full-team risk grid',
    lnd_role_coach_f3: 'Structured prescriptions', lnd_role_coach_f4: 'Season periodization',
    lnd_role_coach_f5: 'Messaging and notifications', lnd_role_coach_cta: 'Start as a Coach →',
    lnd_role_ath_label: 'For athletes', lnd_role_ath_title: 'Your performance lab',
    lnd_role_ath_desc: 'Understand your body, plan your season and show up at your race in the best shape of your life — with or without a coach.',
    lnd_role_ath_f1: 'Personal PMC with CTL/ATL/TSB', lnd_role_ath_f2: 'Integrated blood work analysis',
    lnd_role_ath_f3: 'Training calendar', lnd_role_ath_f4: 'Mobile app with daily readiness',
    lnd_role_ath_f5: 'Personalized Race Day plan', lnd_role_ath_cta: 'Start as an Athlete →',
